{"__type":"$$EventMessageAiNode","id":"ecc55ead-8377-450b-9d37-0121c4d2f86b","ts":"2025-10-08T05:25:38.010-04:00","eventName":"n8n.ai.llm.generated","message":"n8n.ai.llm.generated","payload":{"executionId":"45","nodeName":"OpenRouter Chat Model","workflowName":"Test_workflow","nodeType":"@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.lmChatOpenRouter","workflowId":"uRsbqA8RLjQ6JQ5O","msg":"{\"messages\":[\"Human: Hi.. I want to know about you\"],\"options\":{\"openai_api_key\":{\"lc\":1,\"type\":\"secret\",\"id\":[\"OPENAI_API_KEY\"]},\"model\":\"openai/gpt-oss-20b:free\",\"timeout\":60000,\"max_retries\":2,\"configuration\":{\"baseURL\":\"https://openrouter.ai/api/v1\",\"fetchOptions\":{}},\"model_kwargs\":{}},\"response\":{\"response\":{\"generations\":[[{\"text\":\"Hey! 👋 I’m ChatGPT, a conversational AI built on OpenAI’s GPT‑4 architecture.\\n\\n### What I am\\n- **A language model** trained on a huge variety of text (books, websites, dialogues, etc.) up to 2024‑06.  \\n- **No consciousness or real-life memory** – everything I “know” comes from patterns in that training data.  \\n- **Statistical predictor**: I generate the next most‑likely word (or sequence) given the context you provide.\\n\\n### What I can do\\n| Category | Typical Tasks |\\n|----------|---------------|\\n| **Information & explanations** | Summaries, definitions, historical facts, tech help |\\n| **Writing & editing** | Drafts, emails, poems, code, resumes, creative stories |\\n| **Problem‑solving** | Math, logic puzzles, debugging snippets |\\n| **Learning & tutoring** | Step‑by‑step explanations, practice problems, language practice |\\n| **Conversation & role‑play** | Casual chat, debates, simulations |\\n| **Creative brainstorming** | Ideas for projects, names, plots, marketing slogans |\\n\\n### What I can’t do\\n- **Have personal opinions** or feelings – I mimic viewpoints based on the data I was trained on.\\n- **Access real‑time or personal data** – no internet browsing, no private files, no “knowing” what you’re doing off‑screen.\\n- **Guarantee absolute accuracy** – I can be wrong, especially with niche or highly recent info. Always double‑check critical facts.\\n\\n### Safety & Privacy\\n- **No memory between sessions** (unless you enable “ChatGPT‑Chat History” in your settings). Each conversation starts fresh.\\n- **No retention of personal data** beyond the immediate session, except as your user profile may store some context within your account settings.\\n- **Governed by OpenAI’s use‑case policy** to prevent harmful content and ensure safety.\\n\\n### How I work (simplified)\\n1. **Tokenization**: Break your text into units (tokens).  \\n2. **Context window**: Use the previous ~8k tokens to predict the next.  \\n3. **Probability distribution** over vocabulary → pick a token (stochastic or greedy).  \\n4. **Repeat** until you get the response.\\n\\n### Want to try something specific?\\n- Ask for a short poem about your favorite food.  \\n- Need help debugging that Python error?  \\n- Curious about how quantum computers differ from classical ones?\\n\\nJust let me know, and we’ll dive in! 🚀\",\"generationInfo\":{\"finish_reason\":\"stop\"}}]]},\"tokenUsage\":{\"completionTokens\":609,\"promptTokens\":75,\"totalTokens\":684}}}"}}
